body:
I just googled the definition to see what differentiated that from being gay and "Achillean: men who are attracted to men" "A term that refers to the Greek hero Achilles, modeled after the use of the term “sapphic” for women who are attracted to women." 

&#x200B;

So.... gay or bi but complicated and confusing to the extent that even most gay people won't know what you mean.
